   "hs_code": "08028010",
   "level": 8,
   "chapter": "08",
   "description": "Whole",
   "policy": "Prohibited",
   "condition_text": "a) However, import is Free if CIF value is Rs. 351/- or above per Kilogram. b) MIP conditions, however, will not be applicable for imports by 100% Export Oriented Units (EOUs) and units in the SEZ subject to the condition that no DTA sale is allowed. c) Import of 17,000 Metric Tonnes of Fresh (green) Areca Nut without Minimum Import Price (MIP) condition shall be allowed from Bhutan every year. Such imports are allowed only: i) through LCS Jaigaon (INJIGB), LCS Chamurchi(INCHMB), LCS Hatisar(INHT5B) and LCS Darranga(INDRGB) only, and, ii) shall be subject to a valid port-specific Registration Certificate issued by DGFT.",
